flowchart TB
  AUTO["Automation running<br/>agents + state machine"] --> GATE{Safety gate?}

  GATE -->|CRITICAL result| Q1["Enqueue CRITICAL<br/>ladder step 1<br/>SMS without values · no LLM"]
  GATE -->|Teach-back fail ×2| Q2["HumanCallback<br/>coordinator phone"]
  GATE -->|Consent withdrawn| Q3["OnHoldConsent<br/>automation paused"]
  GATE -->|Unknown triage code| Q4["needs_human_triage"]
  GATE -->|Close without evidence| Q5["Closure blocked<br/>list missing evidence"]
  GATE -->|Exceptional close| Q6["4-eyes approval<br/>2 different humans"]
  GATE -->|Ownership decline| Q7["Re-queue · reason logged"]
  GATE -->|all clear| CONT["Continue workflow"]

  Q1 & Q2 & Q3 & Q4 & Q5 & Q6 & Q7 --> BOARD["Board UI<br/>queue + case timeline"]
  BOARD --> HUMAN["Human acts<br/>accept · handle escalation<br/>callback · sign closure"]
  HUMAN --> RESUME["Resume state machine<br/>e.g. Escalated → Owned"]

  subgraph SAFE["Timeouts never auto-close"]
    TO["sweep_timeouts"] --> SD["Safe defaults<br/>keep_open · next_ladder_step · remind"]
